WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.878
My name is Jordy.
I live in the Netherlands, in Rotterdam,

00:00:10.553 --> 00:00:15.858
and I'm doing some work
in theatres and dance performances.

00:00:21.273 --> 00:00:27.238
To use your whole body
is an important thing to me in dance.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:31.233
And also your mind

00:00:33.193 --> 00:00:37.638
and the things I have in mind
I can open them up

00:00:37.638 --> 00:00:41.828
and throw them on the ground
and play with it!

00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:49.067
The name of the play was "Piazza della Vita".

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:57.558
These play performances are about a square
where people are going,

00:00:57.558 --> 00:01:02.032
walking, eating, drinking, sitting...

00:01:02.032 --> 00:01:05.195
And we are...

00:01:05.195 --> 00:01:08.792
The actors are playing a role in it

00:01:08.792 --> 00:01:14.238
to be the people who are relating
on the streets, eating

00:01:14.238 --> 00:01:17.760
or regular people that you meet.

00:01:17.760 --> 00:01:21.608
The whole story is also about
life and death,

00:01:21.608 --> 00:01:23.868
and being born again.

00:01:26.558 --> 00:01:31.170
I want to be more in inclusive dance,

00:01:31.170 --> 00:01:33.310
participating,

00:01:33.310 --> 00:01:39.112
I want to make a lot of performances,
but one performance I'm thinking of

00:01:39.112 --> 00:01:42.353
is with a group of ten people

00:01:42.353 --> 00:01:45.707
and I want to create in chaos performances.

00:01:45.707 --> 00:01:51.005
Not about another language
or something that you see

00:01:51.005 --> 00:01:55.877
but about some particles
of your experience

00:01:55.877 --> 00:02:02.155
and with all the ten people you are going
into the frying pan, and make something.

00:02:02.155 --> 00:02:05.427
Those are my ambitions.

